"(``\"^1.1\"``, ``\"latest\"``). Naming ``chili3d`` under "
"``javascriptRequirements`` does the same thing; where both are given the "
"dedicated option wins, and a part's choice wins over its package's. Note "
"that not every Chili3D release publishes the WebAssembly kernel PartCAD "
"needs - one that does not fails with a message naming the version."
